  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEDEVAC Link&#xF6;ping</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MEDEVAC Link&#xF6;ping</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lanstinget i &#xD6;sterg&#xF6;tland, IMP vid universitetssjukhuset i Link&#xF6;ping har under 1990-talet medverkat i ett evakueringsprogram av krigsskadade i V&#xE4;stra Balkan. Sedan 1996 har programmet kompletterats med riktade utbildningsinsatser i Sverige och i Bosnien med svensk medicinsk personal.Finansierades i b&#xF6;rjan av migrationsverket, sen 2004 av bist&#xE5;ndsmedel direkt fr&#xE5;n UD.2007 bemyndigade UD Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The University Hospital in Link&#xF6;ping has since beginning of the 90s participated in a medical evacuation programme of warvictims of the Balkan war. Since 1996 the programme has been extended to cover also training activities of medical staff from Bosnia and Kosovo, both in Sweden and in the respektive countries, by Swedish Medical Specialists. Programme financed from development aid money since 2004</narrative>
  </description>
